  "description": "⭐ <em>Don’t miss a festive </em><strong><em>Peppa Pig Christmas Bus Tour</em></strong><em> through London, from Brigit’s Bakery, filled with holiday cheer, themed afternoon tea and family sing-along fun. Enjoy sparkling Christmas lights, iconic landmarks and a magical journey as little fans follow Peppa’s animated guided adventure onboard.</em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🎄 Enjoy a Peppa Pig Christmas afternoon tea with fun themed treats and festive decorations<br>\n🚌 Discover London landmarks like Big Ben and Tower Bridge from a festive sightseeing bus<br>\n🎶 Sing along to cheerful Peppa Pig songs with onboard animated guidance<br>\n📘 Take home a Peppa Pig activity book packed with fun for little fans<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Dietary Requirements</strong><br>\n<strong>🚩After booking, you’ll be asked to select your menu and share any dietary requirements. Please double-check your choices, as they cannot be changed once submitted.🚩</strong><br>\n<br>\n🎉 Looking for even more Peppa Pig fun in London? Don’t miss these special bus tours packed with themed treats, entertainment, and unforgettable moments for the whole family:<br>\n🐷 <strong>Peppa Pig Afternoon Tea London Sightseeing Bus Tour</strong> – Hop aboard for a delightful ride through London while enjoying a delicious themed afternoon tea, interactive entertainment, and plenty of Peppa Pig fun along the way. Book your tickets<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/599704?thm=12311\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> here.</a><br>\n🎃 <strong>Peppa Pig Halloween Sightseeing Bus Tour</strong> – Experience London with a spook-tacular twist, featuring festive treats, playful surprises, and plenty of Halloween-themed fun for the whole family. Book your tickets <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/599654?thm=12311\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here.</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n⏳ Duration: 1 hour and 30 minutes<br>\n📍 <strong>Departure: </strong><strong>Temple (Bus Stop N), Victoria Embankment, by Temple Tube Station</strong><br>\n👤 Age requirement: 2+<br>\n❗<strong>&nbsp;Any allergies must be emailed and confirmed by management at bus@b-bakery.com&nbsp;</strong>❗<br>\n♿ Accessibility: please refer to the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/plan/faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FAQs</a><br>\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/bus-tours/peppa-pig-christmas\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nHop aboard a festive <em>Peppa Pig Christmas Bus Tour</em> through London, where twinkling decorations, themed afternoon tea treats and cheerful sing-along songs create a magical family experience. Little fans enjoy Peppa-guided animations on table tablets while passing iconic landmarks like Big Ben and Tower Bridge, making sightseeing deliciously fun for both kids and grown-ups. Get your tickets today for the <em>Peppa Pig Christmas Bus Tour</em> in London!<br>\n<br>\n©&nbsp;2026&nbsp;ABD&nbsp;Ltd/ Hasbro/HCPL&nbsp;Ltd.",
